1.1 (2026-09-25)

- Added native Docker compatibility mode (DOCKER_SUPPORT="1").
- Added rules/tf_DOCKER.mod for fine-grained container access control via FORWARD (priority -5).
- Added 'tuxfrw-nft load DOCKER' command support.
- Safe table flushing in Docker mode (prevents tearing down Docker rules and bridges).
- Fixed port configuration bug in rules/tf_INT-DMZ.mod (WWW6 ports).
- Fixed DHCPv4/v6 and IPv6 SSDP multicast ports in rules/tf_INPUT.mod.
- Added ICMPv4 essential outbound rules in rules/tf_OUTPUT.mod.
- Refactored and modernized install.sh with checks, styling and full overwrite detection.
- Standardized documentation, paths (/usr/sbin and /etc/tuxfrw-nft) and UTF-8 encoding.

1.0 (2022-02-13)

- NFTables support.
